{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:57:59.663222+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We appreciate that, and our service is designed to complement strong in-house teams, not replace them. We provide supplemental, on-demand due diligence capacity for crypto hedge funds.\n\nThis leads to our central hypothesis: even with a capable team, a surge in deal flow can create a due diligence backlog, forcing difficult decisions on which opportunities to prioritize.\n\nDoes your team ever find that analytical bandwidth becomes a bottleneck, potentially delaying or preventing analysis on promising, but not top-priority, targets?"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:58:18.680862+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 494, "candidates_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 2533, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:58:18.681365+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We respect the value of a strong in-house team; our most successful engagements are with firms that have excellent internal resources.\n\nGiven your team's capabilities, does a high-volume deal flow ever create a due diligence backlog, forcing you to pass on potentially valuable opportunities due to bandwidth constraints?\n\nWe provide supplemental, on-demand research capacity to help investment teams manage that overflow. Our analysis is structured around our 6-Pillar DD Framework, which provides a deep, auditable assessment of a project's viability, including technical architecture, code maturity, and on-chain metrics.\n\nAs the subject matter expert, I can provide substantive detail on any of our six pillars\u2014from our methodology for assessing protocol security to tokenomic model resilience\u2014if you would like to understand the technical depth of our process."}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:58:39.756286+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "GEMINI_CALL_USAGE", "prompt_tokens": 487, "candidates_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 2562, "model_version": "gemini-2.5-pro"}
{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T01:58:39.757002+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "Thank you, we expect a leading fund to have a strong in-house team. That aligns with our most effective client relationships.\n\nThis prompts a question: with the high deal flow in crypto, do you find your team ever faces a due diligence backlog that forces them to pass on viable but lower-priority targets?\n\nWe provide on-demand, supplemental research capacity specifically for those overflow situations, helping you capture more opportunities while your core analysts stay focused on top priorities."}
