{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T02:00:02.244024+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "Those are exactly the right questions, and you've detailed the potential costs of a diligence backlog perfectly.\n\nOf the scenarios you mentioned\u2014from missed deal windows to analyst burnout\u2014which, if any, feels most acute?\n\nIdentifying that critical pressure point is the key. It clarifies where supplemental research capacity can have the most immediate impact on preserving deal flow and protecting your team's focus.\n\nOnce we understand the primary challenge, we can discuss how our 6-Pillar DD Framework provides a structured, on-demand solution to relieve that specific constraint."}
