{"timestamp": "2026-10-07T02:00:31.635658+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3B_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3B", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "OFFLINE", "red_team": "OFFLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "You've correctly identified the potential costs of diligence constraints. Those scenarios\u2014missed deals, reputational risk\u2014are precisely the outcomes our deep analysis is designed to mitigate. The cost of incomplete diligence is often a catastrophic technical or economic failure post-investment.\n\nTo illustrate, our 6-Pillar Framework provides auditable depth. For example, in our Technical Pillar, we go beyond whitepaper reviews to conduct direct code analysis, assessing architecture, smart contract security vulnerabilities (like re-entrancy), and code maturity. This prevents backing projects with critical, non-obvious technical debt.\n\nIn our Tokenomics Pillar, we model supply/demand dynamics, run simulations on vesting schedules to predict sell pressure, and stress-test for inflationary spirals. This quantifies the risk of economic failure before you commit capital.\n\nThis level of detail is how we help our partners avoid the specific costs you're concerned about."}
